Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.61,青空标,atg1,0,0,0,,第一集：升职
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.61,青空注,,0,0,0,,AozoraSubs | 青空字幕组\N校对：汐琥\N字幕样式：NixieSubs
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.16,0:00:02.00,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Gold, gold, gold. Yeah, no, look.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.16,0:00:02.00,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,金，金，金。哦对的对的，哦不对不对，你瞧。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.36,0:00:03.82,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,I'm turning that on and off again.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.36,0:00:03.82,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我又把它开开关关了。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.36,0:00:08.78,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Okay, so I've got the delivery showing up at one,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.36,0:00:08.78,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,好的，货一点送到，
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.94,0:00:11.14,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,and then the setup is taking place at two.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.94,0:00:11.14,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,然后两点开始布置。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.40,0:00:11.82,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.40,0:00:11.82,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,太好了。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.18,0:00:14.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,And then the band are setting up just shortly after that.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.18,0:00:14.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,然后紧接着团队就开始布置了。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.34,0:00:15.58,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Music to my ears.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.34,0:00:15.58,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,这话我爱听。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.78,0:00:17.38,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,And I've put out an office-wide memo
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.78,0:00:17.38,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我已经发了全公司通告，
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.38,0:00:19.78,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,to make sure that everybody is here at three pronto.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.38,0:00:19.78,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,确保所有人三点准时到。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.16,0:00:21.60,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.16,0:00:21.60,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,好的。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.38,0:00:24.10,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,How's it looking?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.38,0:00:24.10,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,看起来怎么样？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.50,0:00:29.12,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Well, I'm no graphic designer, but it's got a personal touch.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.50,0:00:29.12,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我不是平面设计师，但它很有个人特色。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.00,0:00:30.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.00,0:00:30.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,哦。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.92,0:00:35.36,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Brilliant.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.92,0:00:35.36,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,太棒了。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:36.24,0:00:37.68,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Oh, you didn't have to do all that.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:36.24,0:00:37.68,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,哦，你不用做这么多的。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:38.02,0:00:39.56,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Alex, you told me to.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:38.02,0:00:39.56,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,Alex，是你让我做的。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:40.62,0:00:43.32,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,ESEA, Main, 2012, 5th to 6th, CAL-M 2013.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:40.62,0:00:43.32,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,ESEA Main 2012，第五至六名，CAL-M 2013。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:44.32,0:00:44.98,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Top four.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:44.32,0:00:44.98,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,前四。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:46.58,0:00:47.72,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Part-time as well, you know.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:46.58,0:00:47.72,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,而且还是兼职的，你知道。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:48.04,0:00:48.90,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,What could have been?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:48.04,0:00:48.90,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,本来能怎样的？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.12,0:00:50.24,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,What could have been?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.12,0:00:50.24,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,本来能怎样的？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:51.46,0:00:53.00,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Oh, please don't forget the balloons.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:51.46,0:00:53.00,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,哦，请别忘了气球。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:53.54,0:00:55.76,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Every party must have balloons.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:53.54,0:00:55.76,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,每个派对都得有气球。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:57.04,0:00:58.94,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,His favourite map is Overpass.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:57.04,0:00:58.94,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,他最喜欢的地图是死亡游乐园，
Dialogue: 2,0:00:58.94,0:01:02.20,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,And I forgot to order the balloons.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:58.94,0:01:02.20,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,而我忘了订气球。
Dialogue: 2,0:01:04.86,0:01:08.64,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,One of the sharpest minds in Counter-Strike once said,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:04.86,0:01:08.64,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,《反恐精英》最敏锐的头脑之一曾说过，
Dialogue: 2,0:01:09.30,0:01:12.00,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,I won't give up until I win a mother-F words' major.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:09.30,0:01:12.00,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,不拿下**的Major冠军我绝不放弃。
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.00,0:01:18.02,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,And today, today is my major final.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.00,0:01:18.02,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,而今天，今天就是我的Major决赛。
Dialogue: 2,0:01:18.02,0:01:22.98,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,And yeah, we may have been the forgotten department.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:18.02,0:01:22.98,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,是啊，我们也许是被遗忘的部门。
Dialogue: 2,0:01:23.62,0:01:24.56,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,The underdogs.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:23.62,0:01:24.56,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,不被看好的黑马。
Dialogue: 2,0:01:25.20,0:01:27.04,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,The heroes no one asked for.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:25.20,0:01:27.04,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,没人期盼的英雄。
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.88,0:01:33.74,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,But together, we are going to take the DHL eSports Logistics Division to the top.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.88,0:01:33.74,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,但我们会一起，把DHL电竞物流部带上巅峰。
Dialogue: 2,0:02:39.72,0:02:40.72,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 2,0:02:39.72,0:02:40.72,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 2,0:02:40.72,0:02:42.72,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 2,0:02:40.72,0:02:42.72,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,你听到了吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:02:42.72,0:02:43.72,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 2,0:02:42.72,0:02:43.72,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,你听到了吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:02:43.72,0:02:44.72,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:43.72,0:02:44.72,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,没有。
Dialogue: 2,0:02:54.30,0:02:55.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 2,0:02:54.30,0:02:55.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,什么事？
Dialogue: 2,0:02:55.30,0:02:57.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Alex, Miss Ward's here from head office.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:55.30,0:02:57.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,Alex，总部的Ward小姐来了。
Dialogue: 2,0:02:57.30,0:02:58.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:57.30,0:02:58.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,哦。
Dialogue: 2,0:02:59.03,0:03:00.03,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Frankie!
Dialogue: 2,0:02:59.03,0:03:00.03,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,Frankie！
Dialogue: 2,0:03:00.03,0:03:02.03,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,We've met, I believe.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:00.03,0:03:02.03,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我想我们见过。
Dialogue: 2,0:03:02.03,0:03:04.03,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,FACEIT, last week.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:02.03,0:03:04.03,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,FACEIT，上周。
Dialogue: 2,0:03:04.03,0:03:06.03,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Tilted after the first pistol round, full mute.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:04.03,0:03:06.03,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,第一个手枪局后就心态崩了，全程闭麦。
Dialogue: 2,0:03:06.03,0:03:09.03,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Great insight into your potential leadership skills.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:06.03,0:03:09.03,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,对你潜在领导力的绝佳洞察。
Dialogue: 2,0:03:09.03,0:03:10.03,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:09.03,0:03:10.03,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,好吧。
Dialogue: 2,0:03:10.03,0:03:11.03,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:10.03,0:03:11.03,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,好吧。
Dialogue: 2,0:03:11.03,0:03:11.54,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:11.03,0:03:11.54,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,好吧。
Dialogue: 2,0:03:11.54,0:03:11.92,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:11.54,0:03:11.92,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,对。
Dialogue: 2,0:03:12.34,0:03:13.34,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,I suppose you need...
Dialogue: 2,0:03:12.34,0:03:13.34,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我想你需要……
Dialogue: 2,0:03:15.06,0:03:16.31,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Best take a seat.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:15.06,0:03:16.31,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,最好先坐下吧。
Dialogue: 2,0:03:16.31,0:03:19.31,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,The other candidate will be here shortly and we can begin.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:16.31,0:03:19.31,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,另一位候选人马上就到，然后我们就可以开始。
Dialogue: 2,0:03:20.58,0:03:21.58,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 2,0:03:20.58,0:03:21.58,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 2,0:03:21.58,0:03:23.58,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Other candidate?
Dialogue: 2,0:03:21.58,0:03:23.58,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,另一位候选人？
Dialogue: 2,0:03:31.04,0:03:32.04,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Can you speed up?
Dialogue: 2,0:03:31.04,0:03:32.04,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,你能快点吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:03:32.04,0:03:36.24,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,We were supposed to have this done hours ago.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:32.04,0:03:36.24,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我们本该几小时前就搞定的。
Dialogue: 2,0:03:36.24,0:03:39.04,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Keep your disgusting spit filled balloons to yourself.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:36.24,0:03:39.04,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,把你那些恶心的口水气球收好。
Dialogue: 2,0:03:39.04,0:03:46.20,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,You can get it done with dignity or you can get it done with slobber all over the place.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:39.04,0:03:46.20,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,你可以体面地完成，也可以弄得满地都是口水。
Dialogue: 2,0:03:46.20,0:03:51.02,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,I know that I can blow up two of these for every one that you blow up.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:46.20,0:03:51.02,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,你每吹一个，我就能吹两个。
Dialogue: 2,0:03:51.02,0:03:52.02,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Oh, you know, do you?
Dialogue: 2,0:03:51.02,0:03:52.02,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,哦，你知道，是吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:03:52.02,0:03:53.02,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:52.02,0:03:53.02,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,哦，我知道。
Dialogue: 2,0:03:53.02,0:03:54.02,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Oh, you know.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:53.02,0:03:54.02,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,哦，你知道。
Dialogue: 2,0:03:54.02,0:03:55.02,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 2,0:03:54.02,0:03:55.02,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:03:55.02,0:03:56.02,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Wanna bet?
Dialogue: 2,0:03:55.02,0:03:56.02,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,敢打赌吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:03:56.02,0:04:00.02,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Loser has to do the other person's delivery notes for the week.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:56.02,0:04:00.02,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,输的人要替对方做一周的送货单。
Dialogue: 2,0:04:01.02,0:04:02.02,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Deal.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:01.02,0:04:02.02,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,成交。
Dialogue: 2,0:04:02.02,0:04:03.02,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Deal.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:02.02,0:04:03.02,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,成交。
Dialogue: 2,0:04:03.68,0:04:05.41,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,He's really bad at making bets.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:03.68,0:04:05.41,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,他打赌真的很差劲。
Dialogue: 2,0:04:05.41,0:04:08.41,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,I do way more delivery notes than he does in a week.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:05.41,0:04:08.41,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我一周做的送货单比他多得多。
Dialogue: 2,0:04:08.41,0:04:11.41,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Plus, I really dislike losing.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:08.41,0:04:11.41,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,而且，我真的很讨厌输。
Dialogue: 2,0:04:15.51,0:04:16.51,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Frankie, come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:15.51,0:04:16.51,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,Frankie，拜托。
Dialogue: 2,0:04:16.51,0:04:18.51,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,I've dedicated my life to this company.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:16.51,0:04:18.51,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我把一生都献给了这家公司。
Dialogue: 2,0:04:18.51,0:04:19.51,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,20 years.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:18.51,0:04:19.51,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,20年。
Dialogue: 2,0:04:20.31,0:04:22.61,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,I've been here since 1.5.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:20.31,0:04:22.61,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,从1.5版本我就在这儿了。
Dialogue: 2,0:04:22.61,0:04:25.61,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,I chose this over sticker money.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:22.61,0:04:25.61,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我为了这个放弃了贴纸钱。
Dialogue: 2,0:04:25.61,0:04:28.61,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,I've sacrificed everything.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:25.61,0:04:28.61,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我牺牲了一切。
Dialogue: 2,0:04:29.21,0:04:32.21,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Miss Ward, Three Clicks is here.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:29.21,0:04:32.21,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,Ward小姐，Three Clicks来了。
Dialogue: 2,0:04:32.21,0:04:34.21,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Well, why don't we send him in?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:32.21,0:04:34.21,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,那，我们让他进来吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:34.21,0:04:36.21,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Three Clicks, do you?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:34.21,0:04:36.21,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,Three Clicks，你也是？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:36.21,0:04:37.21,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:36.21,0:04:37.21,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,对。
Dialogue: 2,0:04:37.21,0:04:38.21,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Three Clicks, please.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:37.21,0:04:38.21,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,Three Clicks，请进。
Dialogue: 2,0:04:38.21,0:04:39.21,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:38.21,0:04:39.21,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,下午好。
Dialogue: 2,0:04:39.21,0:04:40.21,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Take a seat.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:39.21,0:04:40.21,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,坐吧。
Dialogue: 2,0:04:40.21,0:04:45.21,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Alex, I swear, if one drop of water leaves your mouth, you're never setting foot in this building again.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:40.21,0:04:45.21,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,Alex，我发誓，你要是从嘴里漏出一滴水，就别想再踏进这栋楼。
Dialogue: 2,0:04:47.30,0:04:50.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,This is a branch manager interview.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:47.30,0:04:50.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,这是一场分公司经理面试。
Dialogue: 2,0:04:50.30,0:04:53.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Three Clicks, why don't we begin by you telling me a bit about yourself?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:50.30,0:04:53.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,Three Clicks，不如你先介绍一下自己？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:58.30,0:05:01.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,My name is Philip.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:58.30,0:05:01.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我叫Philip。
Dialogue: 2,0:05:01.30,0:05:02.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Three Clicks, Philip.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:01.30,0:05:02.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,Three Clicks，Philip。
Dialogue: 2,0:05:02.30,0:05:06.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,I have almost 11 and a half years of high-level counter-strike analysis under my belt.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:02.30,0:05:06.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我有近十一年半的高水平反恐精英分析经验。
Dialogue: 2,0:05:06.30,0:05:14.27,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,And I have a YouTube channel with 1.096 million subscribers.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:06.30,0:05:14.27,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我还有一个109.6万订阅的YouTube频道。
Dialogue: 2,0:05:16.30,0:05:19.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Aren't you the guy that had a fight with Thorin?
Dialogue: 2,0:05:16.30,0:05:19.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,你不就是那个跟Thorin吵架的人吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:05:19.30,0:05:21.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,That's a common misconception there.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:19.30,0:05:21.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,那是个常见的误解。
Dialogue: 2,0:05:21.30,0:05:22.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,It wasn't a fight.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:21.30,0:05:22.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,那不是吵架。
Dialogue: 2,0:05:22.30,0:05:24.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,I am Alex Richardson.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:22.30,0:05:24.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我是Alex Richardson。
Dialogue: 2,0:05:25.30,0:05:28.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,And I've dedicated my life to this industry.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:25.30,0:05:28.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我把一生都献给了这个行业。
Dialogue: 2,0:05:28.30,0:05:32.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,For 31 years, I've been on this planet and I've been doing it since birth.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:28.30,0:05:32.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我在这世上31年，从出生起就在做这个。
Dialogue: 2,0:05:32.30,0:05:36.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,My uncle, he actually gave me a copy of CS 0.9.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:32.30,0:05:36.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我叔叔，他给了我一盘CS 0.9。
Dialogue: 2,0:05:37.30,0:05:40.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,And as soon as I put that disc in, it changed my life forever.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:37.30,0:05:40.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我把那张盘放进去的那一刻，就永远改变了我的人生。
Dialogue: 2,0:05:40.30,0:05:43.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Some people with their million followers.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:40.30,0:05:43.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,有些人带着他的百万粉丝。
Dialogue: 2,0:05:44.30,0:05:45.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Congrats, man.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:44.30,0:05:45.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,恭喜啊，兄弟。
Dialogue: 2,0:05:49.30,0:05:54.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,So, how many did you get to in the end?
Dialogue: 2,0:05:49.30,0:05:54.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,所以，你最后吹到多少个？
Dialogue: 2,0:05:55.30,0:05:58.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Honestly, I lost count after 400.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:55.30,0:05:58.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,说实话，400个之后我就数不清了。
Dialogue: 2,0:05:58.30,0:05:59.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,So, how about that?
Dialogue: 2,0:05:58.30,0:05:59.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 2,0:05:59.30,0:06:00.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,400?!
Dialogue: 2,0:05:59.30,0:06:00.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,400？！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:01.30,0:06:03.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,And how exactly do you explain that?
Dialogue: 2,0:06:01.30,0:06:03.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,那你要怎么解释？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:03.30,0:06:04.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,You cheated!
Dialogue: 2,0:06:03.30,0:06:04.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,你作弊！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:09.30,0:06:10.82,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,You cheated!
Dialogue: 2,0:06:09.30,0:06:10.82,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,你作弊！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:11.30,0:06:12.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Then who is this?
Dialogue: 2,0:06:11.30,0:06:12.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,那这是谁？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:12.30,0:06:13.69,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,This your little friend here?
Dialogue: 2,0:06:12.30,0:06:13.69,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,这是你的小伙伴？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:13.69,0:06:15.06,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Is that what this is, Chad?
Dialogue: 2,0:06:13.69,0:06:15.06,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,是这样吗，Chad？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:15.06,0:06:16.90,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,You're just mad that I was right.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:15.06,0:06:16.90,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,你只是气我说对了。
Dialogue: 2,0:06:16.90,0:06:19.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,I blew up 322 balloons.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:16.90,0:06:19.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我吹了322个气球。
Dialogue: 2,0:06:19.30,0:06:25.01,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,There is absolutely no way that you managed over 400 of your disgusting spitfield ones.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:19.30,0:06:25.01,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,你绝不可能吹了超过400个你那种恶心满口水的。
Dialogue: 2,0:06:25.56,0:06:26.56,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Alex, it's done.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:25.56,0:06:26.56,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,Alex，结束了。
Dialogue: 2,0:06:26.56,0:06:27.76,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,I've made my decision.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:26.56,0:06:27.76,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我已经决定了。
Dialogue: 2,0:06:27.76,0:06:28.76,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 2,0:06:27.76,0:06:28.76,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,走，走，走！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:28.76,0:06:29.76,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,He's here, everyone!
Dialogue: 2,0:06:28.76,0:06:29.76,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,他来了，大家！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:33.30,0:06:34.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Woo!
Dialogue: 2,0:06:33.30,0:06:34.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,呜！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:34.30,0:06:37.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Speech! Speech! Speech! Speech! Speech! Speech!
Dialogue: 2,0:06:34.30,0:06:37.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,讲话！讲话！讲话！讲话！讲话！讲话！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:37.30,0:06:38.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Go on, Alex!
Dialogue: 2,0:06:37.30,0:06:38.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,来吧，Alex！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:38.30,0:06:39.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Speech! Speech!
Dialogue: 2,0:06:38.30,0:06:39.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,讲话！讲话！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:39.30,0:06:40.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 2,0:06:39.30,0:06:40.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:42.30,0:06:45.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Go on, Alex! Speech!
Dialogue: 2,0:06:42.30,0:06:45.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,来吧，Alex！讲话！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:46.30,0:06:47.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Is that what you want?
Dialogue: 2,0:06:46.30,0:06:47.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,你们想听吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:50.98,0:06:52.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:50.98,0:06:52.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,好。
Dialogue: 2,0:06:52.30,0:06:53.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 2,0:06:52.30,0:06:53.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,那么……
Dialogue: 2,0:06:54.30,0:06:55.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,I'm sure I've got something.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:54.30,0:06:55.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我肯定有点什么要说。
Dialogue: 2,0:06:56.78,0:06:58.70,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Well, it's the greatest day.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:56.78,0:06:58.70,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,那么，这是最伟大的一天。
Dialogue: 2,0:07:03.30,0:07:04.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 2,0:07:03.30,0:07:04.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,因为……
Dialogue: 2,0:07:16.97,0:07:17.97,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Come on, Alex.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:16.97,0:07:17.97,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,来吧，Alex。
Dialogue: 2,0:07:17.97,0:07:18.97,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,It's okay, it's okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:17.97,0:07:18.97,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,没事的，没事的。
Dialogue: 2,0:07:18.97,0:07:19.97,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 2,0:07:18.97,0:07:19.97,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,看！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:19.97,0:07:20.97,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Look at all the balloons.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:19.97,0:07:20.97,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,看看这些气球。
Dialogue: 2,0:07:20.97,0:07:21.97,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,I love the balloons!
Dialogue: 2,0:07:20.97,0:07:21.97,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我爱这些气球！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:21.97,0:07:22.97,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Look at the balloons!
Dialogue: 2,0:07:21.97,0:07:22.97,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,看那些气球！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:24.42,0:07:26.21,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,I actually blew up most of the balloons.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:24.42,0:07:26.21,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,其实大部分气球是我吹的。
Dialogue: 2,0:07:26.68,0:07:30.37,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 2,0:07:26.68,0:07:30.37,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,你……
Dialogue: 2,0:07:31.77,0:07:34.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,You're cheated!
Dialogue: 2,0:07:31.77,0:07:34.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,你作弊了！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:34.30,0:07:35.30,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 2,0:07:34.30,0:07:35.30,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:41.79,0:07:46.18,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Thank you for calling DHL esports logistics please leave your name and number and we will
Dialogue: 2,0:07:41.79,0:07:46.18,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,感谢致电DHL电竞物流，请留下您的姓名和电话，我们会
Dialogue: 2,0:07:46.18,0:07:47.44,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,please leave your name and number
Dialogue: 2,0:07:46.18,0:07:47.44,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,请留下您的姓名和电话
Dialogue: 2,0:07:47.44,0:07:49.62,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,and we will get back to you as soon as possible
Dialogue: 2,0:07:47.44,0:07:49.62,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,我们会尽快回复您
Dialogue: 2,0:07:51.22,0:07:53.22,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,You people are disgusting.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:51.22,0:07:53.22,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,你们这些人真恶心。
Dialogue: 2,0:07:54.72,0:07:58.22,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,This is horrible!
Dialogue: 2,0:07:54.72,0:07:58.22,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,这太可怕了！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:01.83,0:08:03.51,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,WT*
Dialogue: 2,0:08:01.83,0:08:03.51,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,什么鬼
Dialogue: 2,0:08:03.51,0:08:05.51,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Stupid!
Dialogue: 2,0:08:03.51,0:08:05.51,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,愚蠢！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:14.47,0:08:16.40,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Well, Valve ain't fixing that
Dialogue: 2,0:08:14.47,0:08:16.40,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,好吧，Valve才不会修那个
Dialogue: 2,0:08:23.03,0:08:25.61,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,you guys do you do the graphics?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:23.03,0:08:25.61,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,你们……你们做印刷品吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:25.61,0:08:27.74,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,you know in the corner where it says like Alex Richardson
Dialogue: 2,0:08:25.61,0:08:27.74,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,你知道角落那里写着Alex Richardson吧
Dialogue: 2,0:08:28.98,0:08:29.99,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,You don't?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:28.98,0:08:29.99,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,你们不做？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:29.99,0:08:34.82,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,well if you did wouldn't say "Interim" anymore would it say
Dialogue: 2,0:08:29.99,0:08:34.82,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,如果你们做的话，就不会写"临时工"，而是会写
Dialogue: 2,0:08:34.82,0:08:36.10,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Alex Richardson
Dialogue: 2,0:08:34.82,0:08:36.10,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,Alex Richardson
Dialogue: 2,0:08:36.10,0:08:39.67,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,DHL regional esports innovations manager.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:36.10,0:08:39.67,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,DHL地区电竞创新经理。
Dialogue: 2,0:08:43.04,0:08:45.41,青空英,atg1,0,0,0,,Change my email.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:43.04,0:08:45.41,青空中,atg1,0,0,0,,改我的邮箱。
